SUMMARY:Tri-State Game Night!
ORGANIZATION:Game Knights
LOCATION:Game Knights
DESCRIPTION:<p>The Tri-State Gaming League is having a game night in Shepherdstown\, and you're invited! This dynamic group is always looking for new members\, and you can check them out at Game Knights on the second Wednesday of every month. We look forward to seeing you!\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> Game Knights\, 400 South Princess Street\, Shepherdstown\, WV\, 25443\, USA\n\n<b>Contact Info:</b> The Shopkeep 681-534-1047 shopkeep@gameknightsshepherdstown.com</p
