SUMMARY:Chess Variant Night
ORGANIZATION:Game Knights
LOCATION:Game Knights
DESCRIPTION:<p>The Shepherdstown Chess Club and Game Knights are hosting a chess variant night! Complete a few chess puzzles or teach others how to play your favorite chess variant.\nDid you know that pre-modern chess rules had a vizier instead of a queen? Or that larger than 8x8 boards used to be common?\nLocation: Game Knights (400 S Princess St\, Shepherdstown\, WV 25443)\nDate: Friday\, May 15\, 2026\nTime: 5pm - 8pm\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> Game Knights\, 400 S Princess St\, Shepherdstown\, WV\, 25443\, United States</p
CATEGORIES:Games
URL:https://shepherdstownchessclub.substack.com/p/chess-variant-night-may-15-friday
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SOURCE:shepherdstown.info
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
