SUMMARY:I Would Diorama for You
ORGANIZATION:Make It Shepherdstown
LOCATION:109 South Princess Street, Shepherdstown
DESCRIPTION:<p>The first of a two part series of diorama building.\nJoin Jon in a workshop filled with greebles\, tiny doors\, nurnies\, air brushing\, painting techniques\, and more! The first part is creating your landscape\; cityscape\, ancient ruin\, evil swamp\, etc. and the second part adds all the details.\nTwo 4-hour sessions\, all supplies included\, $60\nSign up by emailing makeit.shepherdstown@gmail.com\nCall or Text 240-343-1973\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> Make It Shepherdstown\, 109 S Princess Street\, Shepherdstown\, WV\, 25443\, United States\n\n<b>Contact Info:</b> Jonathan Schmidt 2403431973 makeit.shepherdstown@gmail.com</p
