SUMMARY:I Would Diorama for You, Part 2
ORGANIZATION:Make It Shepherdstown
LOCATION:109 South Princess Street, Shepherdstown
DESCRIPTION:<p>Part two of the two part series of diorama building.\nAdd details to your diorama with greebles\, tiny doors\, nurnies\, air brushing\, painting techniques\, and more! Paint 3D prints of spaceships\, wizards\, trolls\, giant frogs\, or anything your diorama might need. Add tiny trees\, decrepit buildings\, ancient ruins\, or whatever your imagination can dream of!\nThe second of two 4-hour sessions\, all supplies included\, $60\nSign up by emailing makeit.shepherdstown@gmail.com\nCall or Text 240-343-1973\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> Make It Shepherdstown\, 109 S Princess Street\, Shepherdstown\, WV\, 25443\, United States\n\n<b>Contact Info:</b> Jonathan Schmidt 2403431973 makeit.shepherdstown@gmail.com</p
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture
URL:https://www.makeitshepherdstown.biz/#features
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SOURCE:shepherdstown.info
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
