SUMMARY:Ladies Night
ORGANIZATION:Game Knights
LOCATION:Game Knights
DESCRIPTION:<p>Calling all gals who love games\, laughs\, and good company! Join us for another Ladies Night\, a relaxed evening of gaming and great conversation. We’ll provide light refreshments and tasty mocktails\, but feel free to BYO preferred beverage or snack. Whether you’re a seasoned board gamer or just curious\, come hang out and meet some other awesome women in the community! Feel free to bring your own game or play one of ours. Tag your friends and make it a night out!\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> Game Knights\, 400 South Princess Street\, Shepherdstown\, WV\, 25443\, USA\n\n<b>Contact Info:</b> The Shopkeep 681-534-1047 shopkeep@gameknightsshepherdstown.coom</p
