SUMMARY:Death Café Shepherdstown
ORGANIZATION:Shepherdstown Public Library
LOCATION:Shepherdstown Public Library
DESCRIPTION:<p>A Compassionate Conversation About Death & Dying\nDeath Café is a welcoming space to talk openly about death\, as well as life\, and everything in between. No agenda\, just conversation. Bring your thoughts\, questions\, and curiosity! All are welcome. Tea and light refreshments will be provided.\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> Shepherdstown Public Library\, 145 Higbee Ln\, Shepherdstown\, WV\, 25443\, United States\n\n<b>Contact Info:</b> David Macek and Marian Condon 619-208-3833 davidemacek@gmail.com</p
