SUMMARY:"Shepherdstown Live" First Friday Music
ORGANIZATION:Experience Shepherdstown
LOCATION:Shepherdstown - TBD
DESCRIPTION:<p>Activity\n_Community\n_FAMILY FRIENDLY\nEnjoy free live outdoor music on First Fridays in May-October on the lawn of McMurran Hall\, in downtown Shepherdstown. Bring your friends/family\, a chair or blanket\, and stay after the music to dine\, shop and play! Today's band Undertone!\nUndertone is the project of songwriter and artist Tony Wilkins. Blending the spirit of ’90s grunge with contemporary Americana and alternative rock\, the band carves out a distinct space to explore life’s highs and lows. Featuring Brandon Butts on drums\, Georgia Rae Braun on lead guitar\, and Randy Nicklas on bass\, Undertone is driven by Wilkins’ distinctive\, gravelly voice and unflinching lyricism—creating a sound that’s entirely their own. Undertone delivers a compelling live set that balances grit\, melody\, and emotional depth.\nAs with every First Friday\, shops will be open late. Come enjoy Shepherdstown's music\, unique shopping\, great food and good company!\nShepherdstown LIVE is co-sponsored by the Town of Shepherdstown\, Jefferson Security Bank\, Stoney's Pub\, Nikki Visions Vol 1 and Wind Gap Music. Brought to you by Experience Shepherdstown.\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> Shepherdstown - TBD\n\n<b>Contact Info:</b> Shannon Thomas 6513297063 shanpur@gmail.com</p
CATEGORIES:Community & Civic, Music & Film & Stage
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SOURCE:shepherdstown.info
SEQUENCE:0
